# QA harness artifacts (Playwright screenshots, tokens, local state). Keep the
# qa/ directory itself version-controlled so tests run in CI and keep any
# required reports (qa/PHASE-*-REPORT.md) trackable.
qa/*.png
qa/*.zip
qa/state/
qa/tokens.json
qa/screenshots/
# QA fixture files may contain live auth tokens / DB ids from local runs and
# must never be committed.
qa/fixtures.json
qa/.fixtures.json
